{"articleNo":"113930","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=113930&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"『한글자로 만나는 크리에이티브』참가 신청","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.09.15","hit":"2436","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2014 학부교육 선도대학 육성사업의 일환으로 독서를 통하여 전인적인 인성함양과 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">감성역량을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">강화하고, 책 읽는 캠퍼스 문화를 활성화 하기 위하여 카피라이터 정철의</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">저자 강연회를 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">개최하오니 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><a href=\"http://bit.ly/1D8R7aU\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>강연회 신청 클릭</strong></span></font></a></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;온라인 신청기간은 2014.9.22.(월)까지 입니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/b5ea000f-e9d0-4b08-b910-c9fc0bfaf3a8.png\"> </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>☎ 문의처 : 전자정보실 이병희 478-7173</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font size=\"5\" face=\"궁서\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&